  unitName: Sublime Darkness Feeva
  unitId: 60667
  unitNumber: 1562
  description: Although there are many theories regarding why Feeva parted ways with
    Karna Masta, most agree that it was not due to her own wishes. Had she remained
    Karna Masta's disciple, she might have succeeded in driving off those who plotted
    against him, or even in stopping the one behind the conspiracy. Furthermore,
    her popularity definitely would have made her a vital connection between the
    Holy Emperor and the other gods, thus strengthening his rule of Grand Gaia.
  summonDesc: For the heavens, no, for Grand Gaia itself, my master plays an irreplaceable
    role. I will protect the Holy Emperor at any cost!
  fusionDesc: Securing stability for the Holy Emperor and the heavens is my true
    mission. Will you be joining me on my mission, then?
  evoDesc: I am a faithful disciple of the Holy Emperor. For me to abandon my role
    and part ways with my master is inconceivable.
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
